# Git autonomy — surfy-sdk-demos

For this repo only, agents **may commit and push / sync with `origin` without waiting for pilot validation**.

Still: no force-push to main, no `--no-verify`, no secrets in commits. Surfy monorepo (`surfy/`) keeps the stricter ask-first commit rule.
